You are approaching the old shed. Here you know every trail, every crack. How many times you played here, imagining yourself in caves of another island, or inside an airship!
You step inside. There is a workbench here surrounded by piles of long, waved wood shavings. Various gardening tools are in the corner near the workbench. On the other side your father fixed a few shelves full of all sort of things.
There is a small, metal canister with long spout on one of the shelves. Father uses it to deal with weeds in the garden. This liquid astonishes and frightens you at the same time: the stuff kills weeds at once and nothing can grow there for a long time.
You heard frightening rumours that cannibal-plants grow on Wild Island. Looking around you take the canister and put it in your backpack. Now you feel safer.